    "strategy": "bucket_quota",
    "_strategy": "Each training epoch draws epoch_size examples. Every bucket (a set of window_types) receives a fixed share of the draws, so the abundant easy negatives cannot crowd out positives and hard negatives. Within a bucket, a window's weight is proportional to 1 / (windows from its source_group) ^ source_group_exponent, so one long recording cannot dominate its bucket. Draws are with replacement; each draw gets its own augmentation seed (seed, epoch, draw position).",
    "epoch_size": "train_size",
    "replacement": true,
    "source_group_exponent": 0.5,
